.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-sfx-impact 1  "xil-sfx-impact " 
.SH NAME
xil\-sfx\-impact \- Report which source\-backed SFX cues are clipped by duration_seconds, how much audio each loses, and the config change that would restore it. Read\-only — no config is ever modified.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-sfx\-impact\fR [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-html\fR] [\fB\-\-tier\fR] [\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report which source\-backed SFX cues are clipped by duration_seconds, how much audio each loses, and the config change that would restore it. Read\-only — no config is ever modified.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<SHOW>\fR
Restrict to one show slug (default: every show in the workspace)
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<EPISODE>\fR
Restrict to one episode tag (e.g. S01E01)
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
CSV output path, or \*(Aq\-\*(Aq for stdout (default: reports/sfx_impact_<date>.csv)
.TP
\fB\-\-html\fR [\fI<HTML>\fR]
Also write a standalone HTML review page (default path: reports/sfx_impact_<date>.html)
.TP
\fB\-\-tier\fR \fI<TIER>\fR
Only report cues at this tier (\*(Aqactionable\*(Aq = tiers 2 and 3)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
2\-minor
.IP \(bu 2
3\-review
.IP \(bu 2
actionable
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress the console summary (CSV only)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
